{"id":"dar-es-salaam","name":"三兰港","en":"Dar es Salaam","country":"Tanzania","lat":-6.7981,"lng":39.2664,"dek":"印度洋岸的和平之家","history":"达累斯萨拉姆的原址是莫罗戈罗一带库突族迁居形成的渔村，名叫姆兹兹玛，意思是“凉爽的地方”。1857年，桑给巴尔的马吉德苏丹在此修建宫殿，后来将港口命名为“Bandar es Salaam”，阿拉伯语里“bandar”是港，“salaam”是和平，合起来就是“和平之港”。\n\n1887年，德国东非公司在此建立锚地，随后城市成为德属东非的首都。德国人留下了要塞、总督府和一批规划街道，城市从渔村变成殖民行政中心。一战期间，英国接管这片土地，达累斯萨拉姆继续作为统治中枢，直到坦噶尼喀独立。\n\n1961年，达累斯萨拉姆成为坦噶尼喀首都，后来成为坦桑尼亚首都。1974年，议会决定把首都迁往内地的多多马，但迁移直到1996年才完成。此后达累斯萨拉姆仍是全国最大的城市和经济中心，港口、铁路与工厂集中在印度洋岸边。","culture":"这座城是斯瓦希里文化的典型样本。班图本土的院落、阿拉伯的天井回廊、印巴的雕花门窗、德国殖民者的厚墙与英国人的百叶窗，在同一片街区里并置。走在中区，能看见路德派教堂与天主教堂隔街相望，也能听见清真寺的唤拜声混进车流。\n\n音乐上，生活舞蹈乐队曾长期占据舞厅，DDC Mlimani公园管弦乐队是其中寿命最长的一支。Hip Hop与R&B融合出的Bongo Flava在年轻人中流行，桑给巴尔起源的Taarab也有自己的听众。Oyster Bay一带还是Tingatinga油画风格的发源地，那种用鲜艳 enamel 颜料画动物与市井的民间绘画，从这里流向市场与画廊。","pull":"港口、教堂与舞曲，都在同一片湿热里。","sights":[{"name":"国家博物馆","orig":"National Museum of Tanzania","intro":"位于沙班·罗伯特街，主要展示人类起源与坦桑尼亚历史。馆内有距今约175万年的“坚果钳人”头骨，以及距今360万年的莱托利足迹铸件。对面是植物园，可顺路看东非热带树种。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/TZ_DarEsSalaam_National_museum.JPG/960px-TZ_DarEsSalaam_National_museum.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Museum_of_Tanzania"},{"name":"乡村博物馆","orig":"Makumbusho Village Museum","intro":"露天村落式博物馆，按坦桑尼亚不同部族的传统方式搭建茅舍草棚，材料用树干、树枝、草叶和泥土。某些日下午有传统鼓乐与舞蹈表演，能一次看到多种民居形制。","img":null,"src":null},{"name":"阿斯卡里纪念碑","orig":"Askari Monument","intro":"立在市中心路口，纪念一战中阵亡的非洲士兵。“Askari”在斯瓦希里语里就是士兵。碑身是持枪的青铜士兵像，基座刻有铭文，周围是邮局与老城街道的交汇处。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Askari_monument_dar_es_salaam.jpg/960px-Askari_monument_dar_es_salaam.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1570},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Askari_Monument"},{"name":"阿扎尼亚前线路德教堂","orig":"Azania Front Lutheran Church","intro":"德国传教士在市中心建造的路德教堂，红顶白墙，面向港口方向。它是老城的地标之一，周围棕榈与旧建筑相衬，傍晚光线落在立面上时最好看。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Azania_front_church_dar.jpg/960px-Azania_front_church_dar.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1434},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Azania_Front_Lutheran_Church"},{"name":"圣约瑟夫天主教堂","orig":"St. Joseph's Cathedral","intro":"罗马天主教教堂，1902年建成，尖塔与拱窗带有明显的殖民时期风格。它离阿斯卡里纪念碑不远，内部安静，彩窗与石墙在湿热天气里显得阴凉。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/St._Joseph_in_Dar_es_Salaam_ShiftN.jpg/960px-St._Joseph_in_Dar_es_Salaam_ShiftN.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1563},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Joseph's_Cathedral%2C_Dar_es_Salaam"}],"foods":[{"name":"乌咖喱","orig":"Ugali","intro":"玉米粉慢火煮成的糊团，是本地主食。吃时用手揪一小块，蘸菜汁或肉汁，配炸鸡、烤鱼也行。街边小馆和家庭餐桌上都常见，郊区更常以它代替米饭。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Ugali_and_cabbage.jpg/960px-Ugali_and_cabbage.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":841},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B9%8C%E5%8A%A0%E5%88%A9"},{"name":"米希卡基","orig":"Mishkaki","intro":"腌过的肉块串在签上炭烤，撒盐和辣椒，通常配薄饼、炸薯条和米饭。街头摊贩傍晚出摊，烟从铁槽里升起来，是市区最常见的烤肉小吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Traditional_Tanzanian_food_-_pilau_kuku%2C_mishkaki%2C_ndizi%2C_%26c..JPG/960px-Traditional_Tanzanian_food_-_pilau_kuku%2C_mishkaki%2C_ndizi%2C_%26c..JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"尼亚马乔马","orig":"Nyama Choma","intro":"炭火烤肉的统称，牛肉或山羊肉切大块烤到外焦里嫩，配乌咖喱或米饭。本地人常围坐分食，用手撕肉蘸辣椒盐，是周末餐馆里的慢餐。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Goat_meat_being_roasted.jpg/960px-Goat_meat_being_roasted.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":723},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nyama_choma"},{"name":"咖喱角","orig":"Samosa","intro":"源自南亚的三角油炸点心，面皮包肉末或蔬菜馅，街头小贩和学校门口常见。价格便宜，趁热咬开，外壳脆、馅料带香料味，是本地快餐式小吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Samosas%2C_snack_food_at_Wikipedia%27s_16th_Birthday_celebration_in_Chittagong_%2801%29.jpg/960px-Samosas%2C_snack_food_at_Wikipedia%27s_16th_Birthday_celebration_in_Chittagong_%2801%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samosa"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Dar_es_Salaam_%28Aerial%29.jpg/1280px-Dar_es_Salaam_%28Aerial%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":477},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Dar_es_Salaam_-_Posta.jpg/1280px-Dar_es_Salaam_-_Posta.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":698}],"outline":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[39.0070295,-6.7905427],[39.0098474,-6.7912338],[39.0200815,-6.7904373],[39.0342393,-6.7919496],[39.054128,-6.7900762],[39.0526231,-6.7930641],[39.0536567,-6.7967514],[39.0512068,-6.8057889],[39.0521679,-6.807315],[39.0514341,-6.8093866],[39.0521419,-6.8106919],[39.0551422,-6.8116336],[39.0576024,-6.8153764],[39.0573231,-6.8183095],[39.0599542,-6.8273773],[39.0592612,-6.8315352],[39.0599388,-6.8329981],[39.0583162,-6.8353782],[39.0588758,-6.839242],[39.0576862,-6.8409851],[39.0546678,-6.8409879],[39.0543473,-6.8428751],[39.0605842,-6.851254],[39.0663012,-6.8542816],[39.071253,-6.8676841],[39.0795637,-6.8693748],[39.0846653,-6.872758],[39.0904195,-6.8737929],[39.0908749,-6.8756971],[39.0940624,-6.8755729],[39.0982036,-6.8735859],[39.1034181,-6.8754902],[39.1112732,-6.8765411],[39.1155404,-6.8755785],[39.1168892,-6.8795682],[39.1188212,-6.8800363],[39.1096891,-6.8979756],[39.10645,-6.8974824],[39.1088464,-6.9150686],[39.1058414,-6.9180946],[39.1010154,-6.9208044],[39.0972258,-6.9221241],[39.0880761,-6.